{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired by classic late-90s exploration games with lo-fi horror atmosphere.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to photograph a castle. Now you need to escape it alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knocked unconscious and trapped inside an ancient fortress after dark, you realize you're not alone. Something here doesn't want you to leave. Your only hope: piece together the castle's dark history and find a way out before the spirits claim another victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive. Solve. Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade supernatural threats</strong> - React quickly to avoid ghostly encounters as you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the mystery</strong> - Examine objects and follow clues to understand what happened here</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate and collect</strong> - Find items essential to your escape while exploring twisted corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the past</strong> - Locate hidden bonus items that reveal the castle's dark history</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncluttered &amp; atmospheric</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tight, hand-crafted mystery where every detail matters. Horror lives in the silence between clues and the shadows you can't quite see into. For fans of tense exploration and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo dev project focused on exploration and mystery-solving. Think careful pacing, minimalist PS1-era aesthetic, and atmosphere over spectacle - not AAA production values. If you're looking for a 90s-style horror exploration game made with passion, you're in the right place.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rusty old halberd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/45455b67c19e9448354818bafecdbe826f237081.jpg"},{"name":"Painting of a knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/612394946b492aae8dd01f73ffd39010195fa090.jpg"},{"name":"Beckett's hidden letter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/91fba7f99b0c82cdde9bf226df8b3b0b3282b458.jpg"},{"name":"A granite plaque with an inscription.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/6eaa300766a136edda5e861c4bedfccd1ca8ca49.jpg"},{"name":"A skeleton on the scaffolding.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/4cc2c882cb220af685860a74553badf7d1594d43.jpg"},{"name":"Empty jewellery cabinet hidden in an attic.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/cfa460a1ec66382e218a21510e335d71eeb54c92.jpg"},{"name":"Scratches, scratches.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/c1bcb50490ab8b0187b6fae52c750e7d3c9d3521.jpg"},{"name":"A sword stuck into the curtain wall.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/beaae891b7135a6403cef9a22206526ea227c5f5.jpg"},{"name":"A sword at the end of a tunnel.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/91620180c09439be82410558096d459b9f97aa9d.jpg"},{"name":"Escaped the castle!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155660/e37fa61f4d7aec9c5854d8d93cdc54a4b7c8135e.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3155660?t=1767012282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767012282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155660/8b0bdd483536c91209672152bf8e2383138daeab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767012282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155660/8b0bdd483536c91209672152bf8e2383138daeab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767012282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired by classic late-90s exploration games with lo-fi horror atmosphere.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to photograph a castle. Now you need to escape it alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knocked unconscious and trapped inside an ancient fortress after dark, you realize you're not alone. Something here doesn't want you to leave. Your only hope: piece together the castle's dark history and find a way out before the spirits claim another victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive. Solve. Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade supernatural threats</strong> - React quickly to avoid ghostly encounters as you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the mystery</strong> - Examine objects and follow clues to understand what happened here</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate and collect</strong> - Find items essential to your escape while exploring twisted corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the past</strong> - Locate hidden bonus items that reveal the castle's dark history</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncluttered &amp; atmospheric</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tight, hand-crafted mystery where every detail matters. Horror lives in the silence between clues and the shadows you can't quite see into. For fans of tense exploration and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo dev project focused on exploration and mystery-solving. Think careful pacing, minimalist PS1-era aesthetic, and atmosphere over spectacle - not AAA production values. If you're looking for a 90s-style horror exploration game made with passion, you're in the right place.</p>","developers":["Games Set in Castles "],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155660/a2cfc6d5513e1d90aa0c98a1a56829d90f1d4196/header.jpg?t=1767012282","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155660/814742/2b90cd25ecf2ebb7e2d23197c7cbb498549a1e13/1750875880/dash_av1.mpd?t=1737197031","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155660/814742/2b90cd25ecf2ebb7e2d23197c7cbb498549a1e13/1750875880/dash_h264.mpd?t=1737197031","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155660/814742/2b90cd25ecf2ebb7e2d23197c7cbb498549a1e13/1750875880/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1737197031","id":257090107,"name":"You need light. But light means you are not alone.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257090107/a80525ec0fae582249feed22d1e419cbaf78da9f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737197031"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155660/796743/59238fb5aedbaf1a1ebb9c1c53750a2a6664f270/1750875878/dash_av1.mpd?t=1733656375","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155660/796743/59238fb5aedbaf1a1ebb9c1c53750a2a6664f270/1750875878/dash_h2